<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>中医理论 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%BB%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 08:55:11 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%BB%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>天元纪大论篇第六十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-66/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-66/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与鬼臾区探讨五运六气与阴阳五行的关系，阐述天地运行规律对万物生化的影响，揭示三阴三阳与五运的对应法则，强调顺应天道的重要性。</description></item><item><title>标本病传论篇第六十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-65/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-65/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文阐述了疾病的标本关系及针刺治疗的顺逆原则，强调治病需分主次、辨阴阳，并根据病情轻重、传变规律及四时变化制定治法，否则可能加重病情甚至导致死亡。</description></item><item><title>四时刺逆从论篇第六十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-64/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-64/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文阐述了五脏（厥阴、少阴、太阴、阳明、太阳、少阳）在气机有余或不足时的病理表现，以及脉象（滑脉、涩脉）对应的病症，强调四时之气对人体气血运行的影响，并指出违反四时节律针刺会导致气血紊乱，甚至危及生命。</description></item></channel></rss>